    <briefdescription>
<para>Store the assignments on disk as binary data. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Use a <ref refid="classIMP_1_1domino_1_1ReadAssignmentContainer" kindref="compound">ReadAssignmentContainer</ref> to read them back. The resulting file is not guaranteed to work on any platform other than the one it was created on and the format may change. </para>
